  "_doc": "Combat engine constants, the one source for both engines (ADR-0001 Implementation Guidelines). Read by tools/design/combat_sim/engine.py and src/gameplay/combat/fight/combat_constants.gd. K: Combat GDD constants (seconds unless named otherwise); U: per-realm unit; SUPP: realm suppression by realm gap (Formulas H); BLOCK_UNIT: block points to health per realm. health_units / qi_units: health_max = health_units x U x n_body x health_mult x d_r and qi_base = qi_units x U x n_qi; cost_red_cap and reserve_cap cap those shares; pay_keep_health: an art paid in health must leave this much; min_hit: a hit that reaches health removes at least this. BUFF / DEBUFF: per element, the stat each stack of an element buff or debuff adds (Effects rule 9a, #44). STATUS: the Status Catalogue (Effects GDD): kind tick or curse, damage type and c_tick for ticks, dur in pulses (null = until cleansed), cap (null = none) and each curse's numbers. TICK_TYPE: the damage type of an element debuff's tick. ELEM_TYPE: an elem art's usual damage type by element. status_chance_min / status_chance_max: a status chance below 1, or any chance against status resistance, is clamped to this range (Combat Formulas F). purity_stack_power: each point of an element's purity adds this to its stacks' power (Spiritual Roots rule 8a, Formulas H); water_ice_share: Water and Ice count this share of each other's purity. cleanse_min_stacks: after the cleansing ward's share, a debuff batch below this many stacks is gone. EVENTS / MOD_KEYS / ACTIONS: the Effect vocabulary both engines accept (Effects GDD rules 5-6); a record using anything else stops the load. trig_floor_u: trigger damage budget floor, in U (Combat Formulas G: budget = trig_budget x max(direct damage, trig_floor_u x U)).",
